# Secure GPU Stack: the domains ordinary users can reach in strict mode
# (sudo sgs-egress strict). One per line; each covers its subdomains too.
# After editing, run sudo sgs-egress strict again.

# Python packages: PyPI and PyTorch's index
pypi.org
pythonhosted.org
pytorch.org
# Models and datasets
huggingface.co
hf.co
# Code
github.com
githubusercontent.com
# Ubuntu, NVIDIA and Docker packages, for apt and Docker image pulls
ubuntu.com
nvidia.com
docker.com
docker.io
# System services. Root's traffic isn't filtered, but every lookup, root's
# included, goes through the strict resolver, so these must be listed:
# Ubuntu's Livepatch and snaps, and Tailscale if you use it.
canonical.com
snapcraft.io
tailscale.com
tailscale.io
